# Host microseconds per pen event, by tool and size (host/cost.c, make cost fails above; x40 is the X). Lower them when a
# change makes a tool cheaper; never raise them to pass. The X has 3.9 ms a report at 255 a second: 50 us here is 2 ms.
# 2026-11-02 before the stamp spacing: Brush 24.8/73.5/217.0, Eraser 10.5/27.7/37.8; after: Brush 10.0/19.0/38.4, Eraser 4.1/7.4/7.5.
Brush small=20
Brush medium=35
Brush big=60
Pen small=15
Pen medium=15
Pen big=15
Pencil small=15
Pencil medium=15
Pencil big=15
Marker small=15
Marker medium=15
Marker big=15
Spray small=15
Spray medium=15
Spray big=15
Eraser small=15
Eraser medium=15
Eraser big=15
